			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">残霜护罩：层页生命护罩，共<span color="#ffdfbf">3</span><span>层，每层</span><span color="#ffdfbf">6%生命值</span><span>，破坏后进入虚弱状态，约</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>后再次展开护罩。展开时，完全填满护罩需</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2s</span><span>。护罩展开期间，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">全抗性将短暂+100%</span><span>。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfff">[绝境]</span><span>护盾层数变为2层，每层</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15%生命值</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
