		</Group>
		<RichText x="9" y="1297" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ffffff">虚弱</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="64" y="501" fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W04" fontSize="40" fontStyle="italic" fontWeight="normal" color="#99ffff" width="113" height="43" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W04" fontSize="40" fontStyle="italic" color="#99ffff">扎拉</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#99e5ff" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="62" y="548" fontFamily="SDK_SC_Web" fontSize="20" fontStyle="italic" fontWeight="normal" color="#99ffff" width="90" height="25" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="SDK_SC_Web" fontSize="20" fontStyle="italic" color="#99ffff">Zhara</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#99e5ff" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="223" width="424" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">处于侧后方时，扎拉一个转身，顺便造成<span color="#ff9999">25%</span><span>伤害。<br/>「命曜之姿」强化：攻击造成</span><span color="#99ffff">冰元素</span><span>伤害，且伤害倍率提升，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">65%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="511" width="1015" height="229" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">扎拉升空，消耗<span color="#ffdfbf">18%生命值</span><span>，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">缓慢</span><span>展开等量的</span><span textDecoration="underline">残霜护罩</span><span>，并进入「命曜之姿」状态。护罩展开期间可受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响。<br/>该状态下，扎拉每造成一次伤害，都会为自身恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3%生命值</span><span>(爆发恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15%生命值</span><span>)，恢复总量至多不超过所消耗的生命值，恢复行为可受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响。<br/>当生命值不足以消耗时，扎拉会尽量转换剩余的生命值成等量的护罩。护罩移除后进入</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>的虚弱状态，直至再次开启护罩。<br/>第</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2/3/4/&gt;4</span><span>次展开护罩时的生命值恢复量为原来的</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50%/25%/12.5%/10%</span><span>。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfff">[绝境]</span><span>该状态下会召唤特殊冰柱，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">50%</span><span>伤害，产生的冲击波持续造成</span><span color="#99ffff">50%</span><span>伤害伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1151" width="439" height="172" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">扎拉移至场地中央，召唤3枚<span textDecoration="underline">冰柱</span><span>，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">100%</span><span>伤害；同时将凛冬盛放的花冠裹回蓓蕾，随后令其猛烈绽放，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">150%</span><span>伤害，退出「命曜之姿」状态并移除护罩。</span><span color="#ffbfff">[绝境]</span><span>召唤2枚特殊冰柱，施放后不退出「命曜之姿」状态。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_17.png')" x="1392" y="138">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_18.png')" x="720" y="425">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_19.png')" x="719" y="1065">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="738" y="223" width="424" height="143" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">扎拉进行左右双翼挥扫、转身三段攻击，分别造成<span color="#ff9999">50%,50%,70%</span><span>伤害。<br/>「命曜之姿」强化：攻击造成</span><span color="#99ffff">冰元素</span><span>伤害，且伤害倍率提升，分别造成</span><span color="#99ffff">65%,<br/>65%,90%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="863" width="438" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较远时，扎拉朝玩家冲击而来，分别造成<span color="#b8b8b8">100%</span><span>伤害，仅在「命曜之姿」状态下施放。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_20.png')" x="722" y="138">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_21.png')" x="596" y="811" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="1411" y="1151" width="421" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「命曜之姿」：恢复的生命值将<span color="#ffdfbf">立即扣除</span><span>，等于回血失效。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_22.png')" x="1248" y="1078" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_23.png')" x="1268" y="1099" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/永恒燃烧的幻景.assets/Image_24.png')" x="1392" y="1066">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="1410" y="863" width="425" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">扎拉抬起前肢进行两段爪划攻击，均造成<span color="#b8b8b8">60%</span><span>伤害。<br/>「命曜之姿」强化：能够连续施放2次。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
