			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">冰柱：可使用「钩镰炮」扯倒，对扎拉造成<span color="#ffdfbf">30%生命值</span><span>的</span><span color="#99ffff">冰元素真伤</span><span>并使其退出「命曜之姿」状态。</span></p>
